          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ae5eed08459ec3421ef539f8ce93c3b56c2afb99340f5ee47282a1d8c590686d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9b5c31b008cd4ba699f2fa24980aa637",
      "statement": "aws_elb.go covers two mutually invisible load-balancer APIs: ELBv2 (load-balancers, target-groups, target-health, for application/network/gateway balancers) and classic ELB (load-balancers-classic); a complete view of a cluster's load balancing requires querying both since neither API reports the other's balancers.",
      "evidence": [
