    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a94842681f7b4775ad4150b1e092416e",
      "statement": "The integration/itest-run.sh harness runs aws-get reads against a real LocalStack container via awsapi.StaticProvider, covering ec2-instances, ec2-vpcs, ec2-subnets, ec2-route-tables, ec2-security-groups, ec2-dhcp-options, route53-hosted-zones, and route53-record-sets, but five aws-get resources (load-balancers, load-balancers-classic, target-groups, target-health, cloudtrail-events) are excluded because they need the elb/elbv2/cloudtrail services, which are LocalStack Pro-only and are covered only by unit tests against fakes in internal/actions.",
      "evidence": [
